00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:09.360
know there's legacy debt
that's inside of our platforms

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:13.140
inside of the
infrastructure that comprise

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:17.010
a lot of the operating systems
and basically your business

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.020
as you're doing it
