the ability for IT

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.800
to keep up with the
pace of business.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.660
So what does this mean?

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.750
Well, part of it is
that that legacy debt

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:13.858
